## **2.5 Sovereign Update System**

The update system manages the controlled evolution of the operating system.

It should handle:

- System configuration updates.
- Package updates.
- Nix Flake updates.
- Runtime updates.
- Federation Core updates.
- Workspace updates.
- Service updates.
- Model and agent configuration updates.
